{"v": 4, "paragraphs": ["Walcyr Carrasco recebeu famosos nesta sexta (13), em São Paulo, no lançamento de seu livro \"Fazenda Tropical\". O autor distribuiu autógrafos na Livraria da Travessa com a presença de familiares, amigos e fãs.", "✅ Baixe o globo pop, o app de vídeos verticais da globo", "Entre os participantes, marcaram presença diversos famosos que fizeram parte da carreira de Walcyr. Veja as fotos!", "+gshow"], "images": ["https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/vUHPU9k1hb9zmBPFbaFojTAD-lc=/2048x0/filters:format(jpeg)/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/B/F/Z82ch3TdGdLAtSqHshuw/walcy-carrasco-4.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/Zjkf8IBRjLnixybyvXadj_4yzqs=/0x0:3657x2434/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/1/S/q9PltxTaA9wDoStYLEgg/edu3673.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/lgj5VfObn0YrzCyLIgNpF1-mSco=/0x0:1368x2048/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/b/8/YBlILISayjHqTKU1xg5w/leonardo-miggiorin-16.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/pC_k8B7kYquu-V8JlVXD7UbsvGE=/0x0:1358x2048/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/t/2/SiCbt2QXKpvUyeUnIXRA/beth-goulart-.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/9JZ8Wf7icBfnTvSCWGqQXc-rgig=/0x0:2622x3939/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/k/J/NCNfdGScy3c7z1aDajfA/edu3743.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/YUEtca-yS7mxIR_hUQMrfEcyu14=/0x0:1804x2048/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/K/8/AWeWM6Q6iz0xkUFJmy0A/flavio-tolenzani-27.jpg"], "videos": [{"poster": "https://s01.video.glbimg.com/x720/15187028.jpg", "title": "Walcyr Carrasco lança livro em São Paulo com presença de famosos"}]}